          'di ni <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5245">gzhi gsum gyi cho ga lag tu blang pa'i rim pa nye bar mkho ba nyaMs lung</rs> dang <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:7340">mdo rtsa kar+ma ba taM</rs> rnaMs kyi dgongs pa <lb n="32b4"/> bzhin bkod pa yin la | 'dir dus nges 'jug rgyu <expan>yin no</expan> <note type="editorial">This line is written in a different script</note> | bstan pa'i rtsa ba so sor thar pa × yi | bslab pa so ngas <lb n="32b5"/> sbyong cho ga'i lag len rnaMs | <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:7338">lung</rs> dang de <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:7338">'grel</rs> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4593">gnyag dbon chos rje</rs> <note type="editorial">Possibly gNyag dbon bsod nams bzang po (1341-1433), BDRC ID:P8LS13694</note> yi | dgongs pa ji bzhin × <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4086">chos grub seng ge</rs>s bkod | <lb n="32b6"/> <expan>blo gros</expan> dman zhing × <choice><sic>sbyang‹s›</sic><corr>sbyangs</corr></choice> chung ba'i mthus | nongs pa mchis na mkhas la bzod par gsol | <expan>rnam par</expan> dgar ba'i dngos po <pb n="33a"/><lb n="33a1"/> ci mchis pa | ma rnaMs don du byang chub chen por bsngo | dngos po zhes <hi rendition="#Time"><choice><sic>gshing</sic><corr>shing</corr></choice> pho khyi'i lo</hi> | <hi rendition="#Time">sbron gyi </hi>‹<hi rendition="#Time">sa</hi>›<hi rendition="#Time"> <choice><sic>nya'i</sic><corr>nya</corr></choice> <lb n="33a2"/> ba'i dkar phyogs kyi tshes bcwo lnga'i nyin</hi> | <rs type="place" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5757">yar rgyab kyi sa'i cha | pho brang rgyal chen gling gi kun dga'i ra ba</rs>r | <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4593">shAkya'i <lb n="33a3"/> dge slong jo stan kha che'i bsod <choice><sic>snyom‹s›</sic><corr>snyoms</corr></choice> pa chen po</rs>'i ring lugs 'dzin pa <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4086">d+harma sid+hi sing ha</rs>s<anchor xml:id="a1"/> bkod pa'o ||</seg></ab>

        
         
